  - sceneId: act1_cafeteria
    sceneName: Cafeteria
    music: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueNodes:
    - nodeId: cafe_01
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3f62b7a39a8e69d43a46cb1900aecd4b, type: 2}
      background: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eec78088c5f60aa4dbbb49bb74701594, type: 2}
      soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
      text: "Decides ir a la cafeter\xEDa, que para sorpresa de nadie est\xE1 repleta
        de estudiantes queriendo saciar su sed de hambre y estr\xE9s estudiantil."
      next:
        sceneId: act1_cafeteria
        nodeId: cafe_02
      choices: []
      speakerSide: 0
      hideLeftCharacter: 0
      hideRightCharacter: 0
    - nodeId: cafe_02
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3f62b7a39a8e69d43a46cb1900aecd4b, type: 2}
      background: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 411509c5fc0617a44b698ab8b19934eb, type: 2}
      soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
      text: "Decides acercarte un poco a las mesas, miras que todos est\xE1n hablando,
        comiendo una galleta de Gitane o contando que hicieron en vacaciones."
      next:
        sceneId: act1_cafeteria
        nodeId: cafe_03
      choices: []
      speakerSide: 0
      hideLeftCharacter: 0
      hideRightCharacter: 0
    - nodeId: cafe_03
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3f62b7a39a8e69d43a46cb1900aecd4b, type: 2}
      background: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 411509c5fc0617a44b698ab8b19934eb, type: 2}
      soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
      text: "En eso, miras que una gran cantidad de estudiantes hablan sobre ser
        influencers, bandas o formar parte de alg\xFAn club, la idea no suena nada
        mal y se queda en tu cabeza."
      next:
        sceneId: act1_cafeteria
        nodeId: cafe_04
      choices: []
      speakerSide: 0
      hideLeftCharacter: 0
      hideRightCharacter: 0
    - nodeId: cafe_04
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3f62b7a39a8e69d43a46cb1900aecd4b, type: 2}
      background: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 411509c5fc0617a44b698ab8b19934eb, type: 2}
      soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
      text: "Contin\xFAas caminando, pero el lugar realmente est\xE1 repleto de gente."
      next:
        sceneId: act1_cafeteria
        nodeId: cafe_05
      choices: []
      speakerSide: 0
      hideLeftCharacter: 0
      hideRightCharacter: 0
    - nodeId: cafe_05
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 744ec87fa570be14d8cb7af3caf450f6, type: 2}
      background: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 411509c5fc0617a44b698ab8b19934eb, type: 2}
      soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
      text: "Oh\u2026 creo que no va a haber espacio por aqu\xED, aunque si vi un
        par de cosas interesantes."
      next:
        sceneId: act1_cafeteria
        nodeId: cafe_06
      choices: []
      speakerSide: 0
      hideLeftCharacter: 0
      hideRightCharacter: 0
    - nodeId: cafe_06
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 744ec87fa570be14d8cb7af3caf450f6, type: 2}
      background: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 411509c5fc0617a44b698ab8b19934eb, type: 2}
      soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
      text: "Quiz\xE1 deber\xEDa plantearme un par de metas o cosas que hacer para
        m\xED mismo. Despu\xE9s de todo, esta es una fase nueva\u2026"
      next:
        sceneId: act1_cafeteria
        nodeId: cafe_07
      choices: []
      speakerSide: 0
      hideLeftCharacter: 0
      hideRightCharacter: 0
    - nodeId: cafe_07
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 744ec87fa570be14d8cb7af3caf450f6, type: 2}
      background: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 411509c5fc0617a44b698ab8b19934eb, type: 2}
      soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
      text: "Pero esta fase no me dar\xE1 un lugar donde sentarme. Quiz\xE1 si regreso
        pueda encontrar un lugar a donde ir."
      next:
        sceneId: act1_cafeteria
        nodeId: cafe_08
      choices: []
      speakerSide: 0
      hideLeftCharacter: 0
      hideRightCharacter: 0
    - nodeId: cafe_08
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3f62b7a39a8e69d43a46cb1900aecd4b, type: 2}
      background: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 411509c5fc0617a44b698ab8b19934eb, type: 2}
      soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
      text: "Antes de irte a sentar, decides comprar un panito del d\xEDa para quitarte
